# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the op-fusion programme's host-gap package WPH (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of the fusion integration branch and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. WPH/ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag the pack's B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-fusion-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file the image
# carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# H7b (TIMED, WPH): the ALTERNATIVE LEVER (B1, only when H1 picked async): the combined fusion arm plus QWEN_FAST_PRESTAGE_DIFF=1, QWEN_FAST_WRITE_PACKED_LEAN=1 and QWEN_FAST_BATCHED_READS=async. Eight live (concurrent8_steady, and the 32k shape), every boot a fresh reset, NO audit (the audits add work).
# READ: c2_smoke_check clean (a lever arm also has its engaged lines and no fell-back line), no stall; then PAIRED per round, never by unpaired medians: python3 scripts/ci/w2ln_timing_compare.py pair <control
# container log> <lever container log> --window steady --a-smoke <control smoke log> --b-smoke <lever smoke log> (and --window 32k) for (H6, H7) and (H8, H9), and its floor subcommand over the two control logs;
# the texts equal (text_mismatches empty) and the accepted prefixes equal. ESTIMATE to beat: the pre-stage window falls from about 18 ms to about 9-11 ms and the verify readback and collect lose their per-shard
# waits, so the drafter's saving that the window was eating comes back (2.4-4.4 ms a round) plus about 1 ms of verify host work and 2-3 ms of collect; the pair must read negative beyond the control-to-control floor
# in both windows. Duration (estimate): 35 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fusion-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-wph-all-async
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_equal,concurrent8_code_32k
